{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 612.0, 792.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [70.5234375, 42.5390625, 540.00244140625, 52.65521240234375], "text": "K-LOCK / Macbook Solutions", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [72.31640625, 93.60577392578125, 163.84649658203125, 123.60577392578125], "text": "K-Lock", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [70.224609375, 159.71484375, 482.2620544433594, 254.9752197265625], "text": "K-Lock, one of the Zips for Laptops solutions, is the ideal merchandising and enhanced security solutions for MacBooks. Available in both alarm and non-alarming options, the modern design both cleanly displays produts and elevates the customer experience. Featuring a high security, cut resistant steel cable and plate, this solution balances the demand for maximum security with a highly interactive in-store customer experience. Minimize theft, upgrade the interaction experience and boost sales of high value consumer electronics.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [208.845703125, 251.75390625, 609.943359375, 435.05859375], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [69.328125, 466.1134033203125, 162.28799438476562, 484.1134338378906], "text": "At a glance:", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [71.12109375, 501.9609375, 189.8595428466797, 512.0704956054688], "text": "FEATURES AND BENEFITS", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [69.328125, 520.9752502441406, 520.1209716796875, 558.9752197265625], "text": "", "type": "ListGroup"}, {"bbox": [70.224609375, 520.9752502441406, 252.21595764160156, 530.9752502441406], "text": "\u203a High security, cut resistant steel cable", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [70.224609375, 534.4453125, 208.21298217773438, 544.9752197265625], "text": "\u203a 200 lbs of pull force security", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [69.328125, 548.3671875, 286.2499694824219, 558.9752197265625], "text": "\u203a Sleek, modern design to complement laptops", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [316.458984375, 520.9752502441406, 494.9659729003906, 530.9752502441406], "text"